@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantPadding 20
    BoxPadding 10
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LifeLineBorderColor #999999
    ActorBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    ActorBorderColor #1565C0
    BoundaryBackgroundColor #FFF3E0
    BoundaryBorderColor #E65100
    ControlBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
    ControlBorderColor #2E7D32
    EntityBackgroundColor #F3E5F5
    EntityBorderColor #6A1B9A
    MessageArrowColor #555555
    MessageFontSize 12
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFF0
    NoteBorderColor #F9A825
}

actor "Usuario" as User
boundary "AnalyticsFragment" as Analytics
control "TaskViewModel" as VM
entity "TaskRepository" as Repo
database "Room DB\n(TaskDao, CompletionDao)" as DB

== Entrada a Análisis (semana actual, offset=0) ==
User -> Analytics : Navega pestaña "Análisis" (BottomNav)
Analytics -> VM : loadAnalytics(0)
VM -> Repo : loadAnalytics(0, callback)
Repo -> Repo : executor.execute { ... }
Repo -> DB : TaskDao.getAllTasksSync()
DB --> Repo : List<Task> (todas, incl. inactivas)
Repo -> DB : CompletionDao.getCompletedInRange(lunes, domingo)
DB --> Repo : List<DailyCompletion> semana
Repo -> DB : CompletionDao.countCompletedDays(taskId, lunes, cutoff)
DB --> Repo : int por tarea
Repo -> DB : CompletionDao.getDistinctCompletedDatesDesc()
DB --> Repo : List<String> fechas con actividad
Repo -> Repo : computeStreaks(fechas, data)
Repo -> Repo : build AnalyticsData (weekScheduled, weekCompleted, weekRate%, currentStreak, bestStreak, totalAllTime, completionsPerWeekday[7], categoryStats)
Repo --> VM : callback.onLoaded(AnalyticsData)
VM -> VM : analyticsData.postValue(data) [main thread]
VM --> Analytics : LiveData emite AnalyticsData
Analytics -> Analytics : bindSummary(data)
Analytics -> Analytics : updateBarChart(data) -> MPAndroidChart
Analytics -> Analytics : updateCategories(data)

== Navegación semana anterior (flecha ‹) ==
User -> Analytics : Click ‹ (btnWeekPrev)
Analytics -> Analytics : showWeek(-1)
Analytics -> VM : loadAnalytics(-1)
VM -> Repo : loadAnalytics(-1, callback)
Repo -> Repo : executor.execute { ... }
note right of Repo
weekOffset=-1:
- monday = hace 7 días
- sunday = ayer
- cutoffDate = sunday (semana completa ya pasó)
- cuantas tareas tocaban en esos 7 días (denominador)
- cuantas completadas (numerador)
- rachas se calculan sobre TODO el historial
end note
Repo --> VM : callback.onLoaded(AnalyticsData)
VM --> Analytics : LiveData emite nuevo AnalyticsData
Analytics -> Analytics : bindSummary + updateBarChart + updateCategories

@enduml